<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#S5.SS2.SSS2" title="In V-B OOD generalization ‣ V Experiments ‣ Pre-trained Visual Representations Generalize Where it Matters in Model-Based Reinforcement Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref"><span class="ltx_text">V-B</span>2 </span>Autonomous Driving Environment</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
